7) Patch Cadence & Exploitation Status
8) CVEs & Mitigations (product + dependencies)
9) Hardening & Environment Controls
10) Consolidated References

Tone & Style
- Professional, security-review style.
- Concise, structured, and paste-ready for review requests/short-form SSP.
- No filler. No speculation. Highlight risks and actions.
